---
// FAQSection.astro - Common Questions section
---

<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        Common Questions
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Quick answers to help you get started</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"
      >
        <summary
          class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl transition-colors"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-4">
            How quickly can we start receiving patients?
          </h3>
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 ml-2">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-400 group-open:text-[#cc9933] group-open:rotate-180 transition-all duration-300"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 pb-6">
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              You could be receiving patients in as little as 2-3 weeks. Here's
              why it's so fast: Our digital onboarding system lets you review
              and sign everything online in about 15 minutes—no paperwork, no
              lawyers, no delays. The self-service portal walks you through each
              step. The 2-3 week timeline? That's just for standard
              credentialing that every network requires. But unlike the old days
              of paper contracts and phone tag, your part is done in minutes,
              not weeks. Sign today, start credentialing tomorrow, receive patients
              in weeks.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-green-600">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <span>Average time to first patient: 2-3 weeks</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"
      >
        <summary
          class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl transition-colors"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-4">
            What volume increase should we expect?
          </h3>
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 ml-2">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-400 group-open:text-[#cc9933] group-open:rotate-180 transition-all duration-300"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 pb-6">
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Our AnciCare partners typically saw 20-40% volume increases. With
              USRad, we're targeting similar results using the same proven
              patient acquisition methods that delivered 168,000+ patient
              visits. Results vary by market, available appointment slots, and
              local competition.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-blue-800">
                <strong>Pro tip:</strong> Centers that dedicate specific time blocks
                to USRad patients typically see the highest volume increases.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300"
      >
        <summary
          class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl transition-colors"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-4">
            Are there any costs to join USRad?
          </h3>
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 ml-2">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-400 group-open:text-[#cc9933] group-open:rotate-180 transition-all duration-300"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6 pb-6">
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              No. Just like AnciCare, joining USRad is completely free for
              qualified centers. No setup fees, no monthly charges, no hidden
              costs. We only succeed when you succeed—our revenue comes from
              successfully connecting patients with your center.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
                <svg
                  class="w-8 h-8 text-green-600 mx-auto mb-1"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                >
                  <path
                    fill-rule="evenodd"
                    d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                    clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-green-800">$0 Setup</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
                <svg
                  class="w-8 h-8 text-green-600 mx-auto mb-1"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                >
                  <path
                    fill-rule="evenodd"
                    d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                    clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-green-800">$0 Monthly</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-12" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
      <a
        href="/imaging-center/faq"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2
      text-[#003087] hover:text-[#cc9933] font-semibold transition-colors group"
      >
        <span>View all FAQs</span>
        <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
